        "{Instrument} leser denne noten. Hvilken tone klinger?": "{Instrument} reads this note. Which note sounds?",
        "Denne tonen skal klinge. Hvilken note må {instrument} lese?": "This note should sound. Which note must {instrument} read?",
        "Riktig.": "Correct.",
