        "Den 7. deltonen ligger omtrent 31 cent under tangenten, den 5. omtrent 14 cent under, og den 3. bare 2 cent over.": "Partial 7 is about 31 cents below the key, partial 5 about 14 cents below, and partial 3 only 2 cents above.",
        "Hvorfor stemmes oktavene på et piano litt større enn 2:1?": "Why are the octaves on a piano tuned slightly wider than 2:1?",
