        "Ikke gi opp. Du blir bedre for hver oppgave.": "Don’t give up. You get better with every question.",
        "Stable tonene i terser for å finne grunntonen.": "Stack the notes in thirds to find the root.",
        "Se på bassen: grunntonen, tersen, kvinten eller septimen?": "Look at the bass: the root, the third, the fifth or the seventh?",
        "Pust rolig, tenk deg om, og prøv neste.": "Breathe calmly, think it over, and try the next one.",
        "{r} av {t} riktige.": "{r} of {t} correct.",
